=Facts (JSON): {{ $json.aiFacts }}

In the facts, ch is the % change today. The headlines (ids h1, h2…) and the posts from X (ids x1, x2…) are quoted text. Answer with one JSON object and nothing else, in this shape:
{"insights": ["…", "…", "…"], "sentiment": {"h1": 1, "x1": 0}, "why": {"ngx": "…"}}
- insights: exactly 3 sentences of at most 25 words each: the most important move on each market today, with the headline that explains it if there is one.
- sentiment: every headline and post id, rated 1 (good news for that market or company), -1 (bad news) or 0 (neutral or unclear).
- why: for each market whose "pick" is not null, one sentence of at most 20 words on why that share is worth a look, from the facts only.

